        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/b975b09f-baf3-4022-cd59-913781f5c9d5>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/d59dbc55-5127-6b3f-3ceb-d8346c4dea8f>,
