    OEO:has_scenario_descriptor OEO:OEO_00020248,
        OEO:OEO_00020309,
        OEO:OEO_00020311,
        OEO:OEO_00020317,
        OEO:OEO_00030009 ;
    DC:abstract "ECNO uses an indicator-based framework that tracks progress in economic sectors and crosscutting policy areas, i.e., the building blocks of a climate neutral future. The selection builds on the typical sectoral split, which is also used in GHG inventories, and adds cross-cutting themes that have an impact on the emitting sectors, like finance, governance, and lifestyles. These building blocks or some constellation thereof are commonly found in EU Member States longterm strategies and are often referred to in the climate policy literature." .

