        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Poland>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Portugal>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Romania>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Serbia>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Slovakia>,
