        OEO:OEO_00020317,
        OEO:OEO_00030009,
        OEO:OEO_00030010 ;
    DC:abstract "Distributed Energy (DE) pictures a pathway achieving EU27 carbon neutrality by 2050 and at least 55% emission reduction in 2030. The scenario is driven by a willingness of the society to achieve energy autonomy based on widely available indigenous renewable energy sources. It translates into both a way-of-life evolution and a strong decentralised drive towards decarbonisation through local initiatives by citizens, communities and businesses, supported by authorities. This leads to a maximization of renewable energy production in Europe and a strong decrease of energy imports." .

