        OEO:OEO_00030009 ;
    DC:abstract """The with existing measures scenario (WEM; MMS in its German acronym) is a policy scenario that includes policy instruments and transformative measures that have been adopted and implemented.

The dataset linked below is a data collection that includes more than the German data. You will need to filter for Germany and WEM to view the respective data. Please note that the input dataset also includes output data (e.g. final energy consumption) due to its definition under Annex XXV (https:eur-lex.europa.eulegal-contentENTXTHTML?uriCELEX:32020R1208fromENd1e32-98-1), Table 3.""" .

