<http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/520d1e0f-ec0d-8130-42f5-97b97297db27> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "KS 80" ;
    OEKG:has_full_name " Klimaschutzszenario 80" ;
    OEKG:scenario_uuid "520d1e0f-ec0d-8130-42f5-97b97297db27" ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
    OEO:OEO_00020224 "2020",
        "2030",
        "2040",
        "2050" ;
    OEO:RO_0002233 <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/input_datasets/c3c256f2-27cc-1901-af3d-abaeea847b7b> ;
    OEO:RO_0002234 <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/output_datasets/112e4cc2-4154-bad1-15bd-1e001b5603fd>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/output_datasets/5baa2486-55cd-0b9d-7fa2-ac7efc0b930c>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/output_datasets/6bde2a2d-4c21-9938-5ef0-4aa66ed56f6b>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/output_datasets/77cf2b45-25d4-6e11-08ad-fc40103c86a7>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/output_datasets/8bd1572a-14c1-9a3b-70aa-b248dd924293>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/output_datasets/f5dac9f9-a493-9ded-3991-f3ebfb860231>,
        <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/output_datasets/f70cc2f9-0ec3-6686-91eb-265169344b70> ;
    OEO:has_scenario_descriptor OEO:OEO_00020247 ;
    DC:abstract "In this scenario, the targets for greenhouse gas emissions, renewable energies and energy efficiency set out in the German government's energy concept should be achieved as far as possible, with the less ambitious value (80%) being used for the greenhouse gas target. The biomass potential is restricted and the use of CCS technology is excluded." .

<http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/54a374e9-218b-fdbe-d843-b5ae43e9eb25> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "GreenLife" ;
    OEKG:has_full_name "Germany  resource efficient and greenhouse gas neutral  lifestyle changes" ;
    OEKG:scenario_uuid "54a374e9-218b-fdbe-d843-b5ae43e9eb25" ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
    OEO:OEO_00020224 "2016",
        "2030",
        "2040",
        "2050" ;
    OEO:has_scenario_descriptor OEO:OEO_00020247,
        OEO:OEO_00020321,
        OEO:OEO_00030009 ;
    DC:abstract "The GreenLife scenario (\"Germany - resource efficient and greenhouse gas neutral - lifestyle changes\") is characterized not only by the technical measures in GreenEe2 to reduce greenhouse gases and conserve resources, but also by the will of each individual to lead an ambitious and environmentally conscious lifestyle. Trends towards a sustainable lifestyle that are already recognizable today as well as corresponding niche developments have quickly become mainstream due to increasing environmental awareness and the knowledge of the need to act quickly. Legislative and subsidy policy measures support this development without it being understood as coercion or change from above. In addition to climate protection, resource conservation, decarbonization and consistent energy and material savings, this possible transformation path for Germany is therefore being shaped by the environmentally conscious and sustainable behavior of the population." .

