<http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/6a563705-887b-2289-4b31-d17e49d80339> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "GreenMe" ;
    OEKG:has_full_name "Germany  resource efficient and greenhouse gas neutral  Material efficiency" ;
    OEKG:scenario_uuid "6a563705-887b-2289-4b31-d17e49d80339" ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
    OEO:OEO_00020224 "2016",
        "2030",
        "2040",
        "2050" ;
    OEO:has_scenario_descriptor OEO:OEO_00020247,
        OEO:OEO_00020317,
        OEO:OEO_00030009 ;
    DC:abstract """Like the GreenEe scenarios, GreenMe ("Germany - resource efficient and greenhouse gas neutral - Material efficiency") essentially focuses on technical measures for Germany's transformation. In addition to energy efficiency, the focus here is once again on increasing resource efficiency across all areas of application compared to the GreenEe scenarios. 
Climate protection, decarbonization, consistent energy savings and greater resource conservation as a common understanding are becoming increasingly clear in the course of this social and industrial transformation and are reflected in the political framework conditions. """ .

