    OEO:has_scenario_descriptor OEO:OEO_00020247,
        OEO:OEO_00020248,
        OEO:OEO_00020309,
        OEO:OEO_00020312,
        OEO:OEO_00020317,
        OEO:OEO_00030009 ;
    DC:abstract "This storyline envisions that the climate target (2C) is reached through an equal part of societal, industry/technology and policy action. Knowing that a continuation of current public policies and developments are expected to not be sufficient, significantly higher efforts are needed than the current level of commitment of several of the actors. Thus, this storyline entails ingredients of a little of each of the previously described openENTRANCE storylines and therefore represents an already ambitious reference scenario in openENTRANCE." .

<http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/scenario/7f1e3589-2523-9d18-5db4-2aa5c9a77410> a OEO:OEO_00000365 ;
    RDFS:label "TN-PtG/PtL" ;
    OEKG:has_full_name "TN-PtG/PtL" ;
    OEKG:scenario_uuid "7f1e3589-2523-9d18-5db4-2aa5c9a77410" ;
    OEO:OEO_00020220 <http://openenergy-platform.org/ontology/oekg/region/Germany> ;
    OEO:OEO_00020224 "2030",
        "2040",
        "2050" ;
    OEO:has_scenario_descriptor OEO:OEO_00020247,
        OEO:OEO_00020317,
        OEO:OEO_00030009 ;
    DC:abstract "The scenarios based on synthetic hydrocarbons (power-to-gas/power-to-liquid (PtG/PtL)) examine different ways of using synthetic hydrocarbons to decarbonize the energy system. The TN PtG/PtL scenario presented here is based on a very strong utilization of synthetic hydrocarbons in the entire energy system. In addition to utilizing the sustainable biomass potential, the required hydrocarbons are imported from regions outside Europe. " .

