    OEO:OEO_00020224 "2020",
        "2025",
        "2030" ;
    OEO:has_scenario_descriptor OEO:OEO_00020248,
        OEO:OEO_00020309,
        OEO:OEO_00020312,
        OEO:OEO_00020317,
        OEO:OEO_00030009 ;
    DC:abstract "Relying on both carbon price signal extension to road transport and buildings and strong intensification of energy and transport policies. With its uniform carbon price, it reflects either an extended and fully integrated EU ETS or an existing EU ETS and a new ETS established for road transport and buildings with emission caps set in line with cost-effective contributions of the respective sectors. Maritime transport sector is assumed to be included in the existing EU ETS in MIX." .

